+# core/data/parts/catalog/prop.txt - held props, deep field DF_PROP (CR4 A8; format: tools/partcat_build.py).
+# Pool-backed (CR5): saved in the look pool, selectable in the Outfit tab ("Held prop"). Scripts: core/data/parts/prop/prop_a.txt
+# (a frame at the dominant paw). The first tranche is 59 of the planned 104; the rest is A8b (docs/CREATOR.md "CR4 batch A8").
+# Adult-only props (wine glass, beer stein) are never offered to or drawn on a minor (CR12). No tobacco, vape or drug props,
+# no real-world weapons: the swords, mallets and forks are comic toys.
+slot prop deep=DF_PROP name="Held prop" shapes=food,drink,tools,toys,music,books,flowers,spooky method=S target=104 new=S
