+# core/data/parts/prop/prop_a.txt - CR4 A8: held props, the first tranche (deep field DF_PROP, values 1..59).
+# Frame anchor (portrait_body.c held_prop): the origin is the grip (the dominant paw), `scale 96` makes 256 about 1.5 half body
+# units (bust 15 px, figure 13, fighter 8), +x is OUTWARD from the body (the left paw mirrors it), -y is up. 1 px of the bust is
+# about 17 units, of the fighter about 31. Every prop is one group-1 block that ends with the fist (the paw closing on the grip).
+# Colours are fixed (`mat wood` .. `mat peach`, parts_build.py FIXED); a few props take the citizen's accessory colour.
+# Props are drawn once per image over the body and the head, under the weapon; the chibi never draws one.
